{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Journey Home is a cinematic and meditative platformer adventure set in a surreal world where you travel beyond the boundaries of time and space to find answers to the questions that haunt you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World in Motion</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through an ever-evolving world where environments materialize and dissolve around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hitch a Ride</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No need to travel alone. Hitch rides with ethereal fireflies, giant birds, luminescent jellyfish, or take control of a flying car.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Shape of Time</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift between ages as you explore this world. Go from young to old, and from old to young.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve puzzles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles that blend in perfectly with the surreal world of The Journey Home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Your Mind</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use telekinetic powers to interact with objects, structures, and living creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Many Ways Forward</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb, swim, walk, run, jump, push, and swing your way through a surreal world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find what you came for. This is your journey home.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2600820?t=1757492266","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600820/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757492266","capsule_image":"https://shared.aka